<!-- ===== Who we work with ===== -->
<section class="px-block soft">
  <div class="ht-wrap">
    <div class="px-sec-head px-reveal">
      <div class="px-kicker">Who We Work With</div>
      <h2>Built for organizations where schedule slip and quality escapes aren't options.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="px-whys">
      <div class="px-why px-reveal"><h4>Nuclear EPCs</h4><p>Balance-of-plant equipment with project-specific documentation and traceability requirements.</p></div>
      <div class="px-why px-reveal"><h4>Utilities &amp; Operating Plants</h4><p>Replacement heat exchangers, pressure vessels, and outage-critical components.</p></div>
      <div class="px-why px-reveal"><h4>SMR Developers</h4><p>Engineering-integrated SMR thermal equipment fabrication for novel reactor systems.</p></div>
      <div class="px-why px-reveal"><h4>DOE Contractors</h4><p>Fabrication support for DOE cleanup, research facility, and regulated infrastructure programs.</p></div>
      <div class="px-why px-reveal"><h4>Tier 1 Nuclear Suppliers</h4><p>Subcontract fabrication with audit-ready QA records and material traceability.</p></div>
      <div class="px-why px-reveal"><h4>Research Institutions</h4><p>Custom thermal systems for national labs and advanced nuclear test facilities like OSU's.</p></div>
